{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#cor:dc-ch8-2-2","title":"cor:dc-ch8-2-2","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.md","line":466,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.tex#cor:dc-ch8-2-2","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.tex","label":"cor:dc-ch8-2-2","line":1274,"source":"\\begin{corollary}[Local equivalence of equal-curvature spaces]\n  \\label{cor:dc-ch8-2-2}\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv, lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy}\n\n  \\dcref{ch8:2.2}\n  Let $M$ and $\\tilde{M}$ be spaces with the same constant curvature and the same\n  dimension $n$. Let $p\\in M$ and $\\tilde{p}\\in\\tilde{M}$. Choose arbitrary\n  orthonormal bases $\\{e_j\\}$ of $T_p(M)$ and $\\{\\tilde{e}_j\\}$ of $T_{\\tilde{p}}(\\tilde{M})$,\n  $j=1,\\dots,n$. Then there exist a neighborhood $V\\subset M$ of $p$, a neighborhood\n  $\\tilde{V}\\subset\\tilde{M}$ of $\\tilde{p}$, and an isometry $f:V\\to\\tilde{V}$ such\n  that $df_p(e_j)=\\tilde{e}_j$.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\sketch\n  Let $i(e_j)=\\tilde e_j$ and define\n  $f=\\exp_{\\tilde p}\\circ i\\circ\\exp_p^{-1}$ on a sufficiently small normal\n  neighborhood. The constant-curvature identity gives the curvature match; equivalently,\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy} applies on\n  $K_0\\langle w,w\\rangle_p<\\pi^2$. It yields $df_p=i$ and local metric preservation.\n  Restricting the resulting local diffeomorphism gives $f:V\\to\\tilde V$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Corollary</div></section>[Local equivalence of equal-curvature spaces] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-636f723a64632d6368382d322d32\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-polarization\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy\">↗ lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch8:2.2</span></span>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tilde{M}$\">$\\tilde{M}$</span> be spaces with the same constant curvature and the same dimension <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span>. Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p\\in M$\">$p\\in M$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tilde{p}\\in \\tilde{M}$\">$\\tilde{p}\\in \\tilde{M}$</span>. Choose arbitrary orthonormal bases <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\{ e_j\\} $\">$\\{ e_j\\} $</span> of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_p(M)$\">$T_p(M)$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\{ \\tilde{e}_j\\} $\">$\\{ \\tilde{e}_j\\} $</span> of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_{\\tilde{p}}(\\tilde{M})$\">$T_{\\tilde{p}}(\\tilde{M})$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$j=1,\\dots ,n$\">$j=1,\\dots ,n$</span>. Then there exist a neighborhood <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$V\\subset M$\">$V\\subset M$</span> of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span>, a neighborhood <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tilde{V}\\subset \\tilde{M}$\">$\\tilde{V}\\subset \\tilde{M}$</span> of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tilde{p}$\">$\\tilde{p}$</span>, and an isometry <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:V\\to \\tilde{V}$\">$f:V\\to \\tilde{V}$</span> such that <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$df_p(e_j)=\\tilde{e}_j$\">$df_p(e_j)=\\tilde{e}_j$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$i(e_j)=\\tilde e_j$\">$i(e_j)=\\tilde e_j$</span> and define <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f=\\exp _{\\tilde p}\\circ i\\circ \\exp _p^{-1}$\">$f=\\exp _{\\tilde p}\\circ i\\circ \\exp _p^{-1}$</span> on a sufficiently small normal neighborhood. The constant-curvature identity gives the curvature match; equivalently, <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature%23lem%3Adc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368382d322d322d73656d69636f6e6a7567616379\">item 3</a> applies on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K_0\\langle w,w\\rangle _p&lt;\\pi ^2$\">$K_0\\langle w,w\\rangle _p&lt;\\pi ^2$</span>. It yields <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$df_p=i$\">$df_p=i$</span> and local metric preservation. Restricting the resulting local diffeomorphism gives <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:V\\to \\tilde V$\">$f:V\\to \\tilde V$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#thm:dc-ch8-2-1","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#cor:dc-ch8-2-3","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#cor:dc-ch8-2-3","title":"cor:dc-ch8-2-3","label":"cor:dc-ch8-2-3"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#cor:dc-ch8-2-2","title":"cor:dc-ch8-2-2","tex":"\\begin{corollary}[Local equivalence of equal-curvature spaces]\n  \\label{cor:dc-ch8-2-2}\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball, lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv, lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy}\n\n  \\dcref{ch8:2.2}\n  Let $M$ and $\\tilde{M}$ be spaces with the same constant curvature and the same\n  dimension $n$. Let $p\\in M$ and $\\tilde{p}\\in\\tilde{M}$. Choose arbitrary\n  orthonormal bases $\\{e_j\\}$ of $T_p(M)$ and $\\{\\tilde{e}_j\\}$ of $T_{\\tilde{p}}(\\tilde{M})$,\n  $j=1,\\dots,n$. Then there exist a neighborhood $V\\subset M$ of $p$, a neighborhood\n  $\\tilde{V}\\subset\\tilde{M}$ of $\\tilde{p}$, and an isometry $f:V\\to\\tilde{V}$ such\n  that $df_p(e_j)=\\tilde{e}_j$.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\sketch\n  Let $i(e_j)=\\tilde e_j$ and define\n  $f=\\exp_{\\tilde p}\\circ i\\circ\\exp_p^{-1}$ on a sufficiently small normal\n  neighborhood. The constant-curvature identity gives the curvature match; equivalently,\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy} applies on\n  $K_0\\langle w,w\\rangle_p<\\pi^2$. It yields $df_p=i$ and local metric preservation.\n  Restricting the resulting local diffeomorphism gives $f:V\\to\\tilde V$.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-transfer-const","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-velocity-frame","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-const-solution","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-equiv","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-local-diffeo","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-polarization","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-mfderiv-bridge","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-diff-zero","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-zero","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-no-conjugate-ball","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-mfderiv","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-2-semiconjugacy","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}